    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453530/extras/154dd1f09935c01a86e8b840e23d3db0.avif?t=1753698937\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Coffie Simulator</strong>, step into the world of coffee and experience the thrill (and chaos) of running your own caf\u00e9! Your dream? To own the best coffee shop in town. But it won\u2019t be easy\u2014you\u2019ll need to master the art of coffee-making, keep your customers happy, and manage your shop like a pro.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RULE YOUR OWN SHOP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453530/extras/1e594bcd8d3d07ad9fd026e8dceb92ba.poster.avif?t=1753698937\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453530/extras/1e594bcd8d3d07ad9fd026e8dceb92ba.webm?t=1753698937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453530/extras/1e594bcd8d3d07ad9fd026e8dceb92ba.mp4?t=1753698937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design &amp; Customize</strong> \u2013 Create the coffee shop of your dreams!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stock Up &amp; Manage</strong> \u2013 Keep an eye on your supplies or risk running out when you need them most.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handle Your Finances</strong> \u2013 Every bean counts! Spend wisely and invest in upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand &amp; Upgrade</strong> \u2013 Improve your shop to attract more customers and build your coffee empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SERVE THE PEOPLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453530/extras/0eba6c07081ad6361cc09c4048da50b7.poster.avif?t=1753698937\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453530/extras/0eba6c07081ad6361cc09c4048da50b7.webm?t=1753698937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453530/extras/0eba6c07081ad6361cc09c4048da50b7.mp4?t=1753698937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 500 Unique Customers</strong> \u2013 Each with their own personalities and preferences!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Choices Matter</strong> \u2013 Treat customers well\u2026 or badly! Your reputation will shape how they react.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay on Your Toes</strong> \u2013 Follow every order carefully; slow service or mistakes could drive customers away forever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENTER THE WORLD OF COFFEE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453530/extras/d34b900dc757360ab4fe235aa33f4b0b.poster.avif?t=1753698937\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453530/extras/d34b900dc757360ab4fe235aa33f4b0b.webm?t=1753698937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453530/extras/d34b900dc757360ab4fe235aa33f4b0b.mp4?t=1753698937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From Simple to Complex</strong> \u2013 Learn and master recipes, from a basic espresso to the most intricate latte art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Brewing Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Use professional barista tools to craft the perfect cup.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Espresso Game</strong> \u2013 Precision is key! Extract, steam, and serve like a real barista.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE A DYNAMIC WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453530/extras/e9b1649393d426cfcc33f045a82ac982.poster.avif?t=1753698937\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453530/extras/e9b1649393d426cfcc33f045a82ac982.webm?t=1753698937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453530/extras/e9b1649393d426cfcc33f045a82ac982.mp4?t=1753698937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every Save is Unique</strong> \u2013 No two playthroughs are the same! Customers, events, and challenges change with each game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weather Affects Business</strong> \u2013 A rainy day might mean more customers\u2014how will you adapt?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surprises Await</strong> \u2013 Uncover hidden events and unexpected twists as you grow your caf\u00e9.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Support development by adding the game to your wishlist!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453530/extras/c3de7981d22dcc1d5f6c163f76c9424f.poster.avif?t=1753698937\" width=396 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453530/extras/c3de7981d22dcc1d5f6c163f76c9424f.webm?t=1753698937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453530/extras/c3de7981d22dcc1d5f6c163f76c9424f.mp4?t=1753698937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453530/extras/154dd1f09935c01a86e8b840e23d3db0.avif?t=1753698937\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Coffie Simulator</strong>, step into the world of coffee and experience the thrill (and chaos) of running your own caf\u00e9! Your dream? To own the best coffee shop in town. But it won\u2019t be easy\u2014you\u2019ll need to master the art of coffee-making, keep your customers happy, and manage your shop like a pro.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RULE YOUR OWN SHOP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453530/extras/1e594bcd8d3d07ad9fd026e8dceb92ba.poster.avif?t=1753698937\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453530/extras/1e594bcd8d3d07ad9fd026e8dceb92ba.webm?t=1753698937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453530/extras/1e594bcd8d3d07ad9fd026e8dceb92ba.mp4?t=1753698937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design &amp; Customize</strong> \u2013 Create the coffee shop of your dreams!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stock Up &amp; Manage</strong> \u2013 Keep an eye on your supplies or risk running out when you need them most.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handle Your Finances</strong> \u2013 Every bean counts! Spend wisely and invest in upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand &amp; Upgrade</strong> \u2013 Improve your shop to attract more customers and build your coffee empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SERVE THE PEOPLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453530/extras/0eba6c07081ad6361cc09c4048da50b7.poster.avif?t=1753698937\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453530/extras/0eba6c07081ad6361cc09c4048da50b7.webm?t=1753698937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453530/extras/0eba6c07081ad6361cc09c4048da50b7.mp4?t=1753698937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 500 Unique Customers</strong> \u2013 Each with their own personalities and preferences!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Choices Matter</strong> \u2013 Treat customers well\u2026 or badly! Your reputation will shape how they react.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay on Your Toes</strong> \u2013 Follow every order carefully; slow service or mistakes could drive customers away forever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENTER THE WORLD OF COFFEE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453530/extras/d34b900dc757360ab4fe235aa33f4b0b.poster.avif?t=1753698937\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453530/extras/d34b900dc757360ab4fe235aa33f4b0b.webm?t=1753698937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453530/extras/d34b900dc757360ab4fe235aa33f4b0b.mp4?t=1753698937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From Simple to Complex</strong> \u2013 Learn and master recipes, from a basic espresso to the most intricate latte art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Brewing Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Use professional barista tools to craft the perfect cup.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Espresso Game</strong> \u2013 Precision is key! Extract, steam, and serve like a real barista.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE A DYNAMIC WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453530/extras/e9b1649393d426cfcc33f045a82ac982.poster.avif?t=1753698937\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453530/extras/e9b1649393d426cfcc33f045a82ac982.webm?t=1753698937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453530/extras/e9b1649393d426cfcc33f045a82ac982.mp4?t=1753698937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every Save is Unique</strong> \u2013 No two playthroughs are the same! Customers, events, and challenges change with each game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weather Affects Business</strong> \u2013 A rainy day might mean more customers\u2014how will you adapt?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surprises Await</strong> \u2013 Uncover hidden events and unexpected twists as you grow your caf\u00e9.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Support development by adding the game to your wishlist!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453530/extras/c3de7981d22dcc1d5f6c163f76c9424f.poster.avif?t=1753698937\" width=396 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453530/extras/c3de7981d22dcc1d5f6c163f76c9424f.webm?t=1753698937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453530/extras/c3de7981d22dcc1d5f6c163f76c9424f.mp4?t=1753698937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Coffie Simulator is a coffee simulator game. Run your own caf\u00e9, serve 500+ unique customers, and master the art of coffee-making! Customize, upgrade, and manage your shop while handling orders with precision. Every choice matters\u2014your reputation shapes the experience. Can you succeed?",
